ype":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contextMenu"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"menuItems","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preview","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contextmenu(menuitems:preview:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swa